      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAHARA PEARL (7) settled back from out wide but wound up hard into the minor money, finishing 5.5 lengths from the winner (23.16) at this track in Grade 5. Can find winning form. DON'T DO IT (1) has not raced since scoring (23.85) over 400m at this track 12 weeks ago. Expected to feature on best form. TARA REBEL (2) turned in a better effort at Maitland last start, finishing second behind Chevy The Beast (22.83) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Can measure up. KICKER ZOOM (3) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into third last time out (22.78) over 400m at Maitland.",
